{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ryousuke's classmate who sits next to him. Her mother is a famous pianist, and she is also pretty skilled at playing the piano. Instead of socializing, she plays the piano in the music room every day."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She and her younger sister Meguru both aimed to become professional pianists when they were young, but later it became clear that Meguru had talent while Rikka didn't, so she gave up on that dream. After Meguru was accepted into a music school in Salzburg, her family moved there, but she decided to stay behind in Japan, and has been living alone ever since."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c19051"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"隣の席のクラスメイト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ほとんど友達付き合いをせず、その交友関係はとても希薄。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親ともに高名な音楽家であり、本人もピアノの腕前はかなりのもの。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし部活動に所属する気はないらしく、放課後はいつも、第二音楽室でひとりピアノを弾いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その音色に癒される学生も多いが、どうしていつも鍵盤を弾いているのか、その真意は誰にも分からないでいる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3807","sourceWorkId":"19483","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"隣の席のクラスメイト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ほとんど友達付き合いをせず、その交友関係はとても希薄。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親ともに高名な音楽家であり、本人もピアノの腕前はかなりのもの。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし部活動に所属する気はないらしく、放課後はいつも第二音楽室でひとりピアノを弾いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その音色に癒される学生も多いが、どうしていつも鍵盤を弾いているのか、その真意は誰にも分からないでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「理由なんてないわ。 1人で弾きたいから弾いてるだけよ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"25686"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"学年","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"25686","value":"2年生"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/54/5450b261f3cfc745cce883e4804231be36a1e7cf3355550d628326b39c4e46ba.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bf/bf3ae73116883c91153a579a8e639f8e579c59d3fbceb62